---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import LegalIdentity from '../../components/LegalIdentity.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, LAST_UPDATED, SITE_NAMES } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title={`Contact ${SITE_NAMES[lang]}: a fee, a question, the widget`} description="Write to Citizenship Test Free when a fee or residence rule looks out of date, when a practice question seems wrong, or to embed the free mock test on a library or college site." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Contact' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Contact</h1>
    <p>Email: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>. A person reads every message.</p>
    <h2>A fee or a rule looks out of date</h2>
    <p>Tell us the country and the rule and, if you have it, the official page that says otherwise. Fees in the three countries change at set dates (the UK fees table, the Australian indexation on 1 July, the IRCC fee list), and some official pages are updated later than others. We read the official source again, correct the parameter file and date the change.</p>
    <h2>A practice question seems wrong</h2>
    <p>Give us the first words of the question. Each one names the chapter of the guide it was written from; if the guide and current reality differ, we rewrite or remove it.</p>
    <h2>What we cannot do</h2>
    <p>We are not a government office or an adviser. We cannot book a test, check an application or advise on a personal case. Please do not send passport numbers, application numbers or dates of birth.</p>
    <h2>Using a test on your own site</h2>
    <p>Libraries, colleges and community groups that help new residents can show the mock test in an iframe at no cost: see the <a href={route('widget', lang)}>embed page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Publisher</h2>
    <LegalIdentity lang={lang} />
    <p>Updated: {LAST_UPDATED}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
